<h2 id="whats-next" data-text="What's next" tabindex="-1">What's next</h2>

<ul>
<li>Learn more about the <a href="https://edmcouncil.org/frameworks/cdmc/">CDMC
framework</a> on the EDM Council
website.</li>
<li>Read about the security controls used by the <a href="/architecture/confidential-data-warehouse-blueprint">secured data warehouse
blueprint</a>.</li>
<li>Track training data provenance and pipeline transformations for AI and
machine learning workloads with <a href="/dataplex/docs/about-data-lineage">Knowledge Catalog
data lineage</a>.</li>
<li>Learn more about <a href="https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/datacatalog-tag-engine/tree/cloud-run">Tag
Engine</a>.</li>
<li>Review sample automation scripts in the archived <a href="https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cdmc">Google Cloud CDMC
Reference Architecture</a>
repository on GitHub.</li>
</ul>


  

  
